          "description": "College-level deep-dive course on Microsoft Excel taught the way an undergraduate Business Analytics / Computer Applications professor would teach it (GO! by Gaskin, MyITLab, SAM, Microsoft Learn). Eighteen lessons take students from Excel fundamentals through advanced data analysis: formulas and references, all function families, logical and lookup functions (XLOOKUP, INDEX/MATCH), text and date functions, formatting and conditional formatting, Tables, charts, sorting/filtering, what-if analysis, PivotTables, Power Query, macros and Office Scripts, and Copilot AI. Every lesson includes hands-on practice exercises with sample data so students learn by doing.",
          "lessons": 18,
