                  "content": "\"Analysts do not spend most of their time on clever formulas. They spend it getting messy data into clean, consistent shape. Master AutoFill, Flash Fill, and Paste Special, and you reclaim hours every week.\"\n\nThe techniques in this lesson are the unglamorous heart of real spreadsheet work. Speed here pays off in every project that follows.",
