"333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">50</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">40</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">35</text><text x=\"740\" y=\"333\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">30</text><polyline points=\"830,310 870,325 910,335 990,345\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"70\" y=\"360\" width=\"960\" height=\"70\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"403\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Phone</text><text x=\"380\" y=\"403\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">20</text><text x=\"500\" y=\"403\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">25</text><text x=\"620\" y=\"403\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">35</text><text x=\"740\" y=\"403\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">50</text><polyline points=\"830,415 870,405 910,395 990,375\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"100\" y=\"470\" width=\"900\" height=\"440\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"522\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">STEPS</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"572\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">1. Click F2 (Trend for Laptop)</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"614\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">2. Insert, Sparklines, Line</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"656\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">3. Data Range B2:E2, Location F2, OK</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"698\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">4. Drag F2 fill handle down to F4</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"740\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">5. Sparkline tab, tick High and Low points</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"800\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Laptop and Phone trend up, Tablet trends down</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"840\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Each Sparkline reads its own row of months</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"1010\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1055\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">A trend column without a single full-size chart</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Practice adding Line Sparklines to a monthly product table"
