                  "explanation": "Setting Scaling to fit all columns on one page (Width = 1 page) pulls the stray columns back onto a single page width. Print Titles → Rows to repeat at top makes the header row reprint on every page, so page two is no longer headerless. Freeze Panes, Merge, Wrap Text, and file format do not control how the sheet prints.",
